  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 720.09 Qualifications of Level 2 Assessors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 720.09 Qualifications of Level 2 Assessors.\n\n(a) A level 2 assessment other than one conducted by the department pursuant to Env-Dw 720.07(b) shall be conducted by:\n\n(1) For transient NCWSs, an operator certified at Grade 1A or higher; and\n\n(2) For NTNCWSs and CWSs, an operator certified at a grade comparable to or higher than the required grade for that system.\n\n(b) The individual(s) who conducted a level 1 assessment may participate in a level 2 assessment at the same PWS but shall not conduct the level 2 assessment without at least one additional qualified individual.\n\nSource. #9760, eff 7-30-10; ss by #10771, eff 2-1-15; SS BY #14427, eff 11-21-25, EXPIRES 11-21-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
